Stop AsseticExtension from using the deprecated Twig 1 class names.

kriswallsmith/assetic v1.4.0 is the last release of the package, so this can
not be fixed by upgrading. It declares its Twig extension in terms of
Twig_Extension and Twig_Extension_GlobalsInterface, and loading the latter
makes Twig >= 2.7 emit "Using the Twig_Extension_GlobalsInterface class is
deprecated". Both names are plain aliases of the classes used below, so the
extension keeps working exactly the same.

--- a/src/Assetic/Extension/Twig/AsseticExtension.php
+++ b/src/Assetic/Extension/Twig/AsseticExtension.php
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
 use Assetic\Factory\AssetFactory;
 use Assetic\ValueSupplierInterface;
 
-class AsseticExtension extends \Twig_Extension implements \Twig_Extension_GlobalsInterface
+class AsseticExtension extends \Twig\Extension\AbstractExtension implements \Twig\Extension\GlobalsInterface
 {
     protected $factory;
     protected $functions;
